# Scene edits

For work on one harbour chapter (01–06):

- Read `docs/SCENE-MAP.md` first.
- Open only files mapped to the affected scene.
- Do not read `CHANGELOG.md`, old plans, review screenshots or unrelated scenes unless explicitly requested.
- Do not create screenshots or recordings unless explicitly requested.
- Keep editable layout values in the scene's `src/story/sceneNN/config.js`. `src/data/chapters.js` holds the shared scroll numbers and the assembled list.
- For small changes, run only `npm run build` and inspect the affected scene at http://localhost:5173/#chapter-0N.

A ticket change in scene 03 reads the map, then opens `#chapter-03` in `index.html`, `src/story/scene03/config.js`, the 03 blocks in `src/styles.css`, `src/ui/ticketCard.js` and `src/ui/departureBoard.js`.
